      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The <b>AIR QUALITY TESTER</b> lets you assess the air composition of any
    room. Power it on to scan the atmosphere; the display will register excess levels
    of <b>SULFUR, MOLD, METHANE</b>, or <b>CARBON MONOXIDE</b>.\n\nEach entity leaves
    a distinct gas signature\u2014note which readings spike to uncover its resistances
    and susceptibilities."
