  m_text: "The <b>THERMOMETER</b> displays the ambient temperature in real time.
    As you approach a supernatural echo, watch for sudden drops or heat surges\u2014these
    thermal anomalies reveal the echo\u2019s thermal profile, hinting at its resistance
    or vulnerability. Be sure have your thermometer ready when you detect an echo."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
