  m_text: "The <b>COMPASS</b> can be used to detect disturbances in the magnetic
    field. Supernatural echoes can warp local magnetism, twisting the needle into
    uncanny motions.\n\nWhen you lock onto an echo, keep the compass in hand and
    watch for these anomalies: a <b>FLIPPED</b> orientation, a needle that <b>CHANGES
    RANDOMLY</b>, a steady <b>SPIN</b>, or a subtle <b>SHAKE</b>\u2014each pattern
    reveals a fragment of the echo\u2019s magnetic signature."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
