  m_text: "The <b>GEIGER COUNTER</b> reveals ambient ionizing radiation around a
    detected echo. Sweep the device through the area and note how the click rate
    and intensity fluctuate\u2014each echo leaves a unique radiation imprint. Record
    these readings and cross-reference them with your other tool data to fully chart
    an entity\u2019s hidden resistances and vulnerabilities."
